{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04854","headline":"和尹懋登南楼 · 张均","name":"和尹懋登南楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"客来已两春，更瞻韶光早。\n花鸟既环合，江山复骈抱。\n楼形写北潭，堞势凌青岛。\n白云谢归鴈，驰怀洛阳道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04854.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04854","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}